-# create the designated file with a certain number of attributes and a=
 certain
-# number of data extents. Reverse order synchronous data writes are us=
ed to
-# create fragmented files, though with the way the filesystem freespac=
e is
-# fragmented, this is probably not necessary. Create the attributes fi=
rst so
-# that they cause the initial fork offset pressure to move it about.
