+#! /bin/bash
+# FS QA Test No. 078
+#
+# Check several growfs corner cases
+#
+#---------------------------------------------------------------------=
--
+# Copyright (c) 2000-2003,2006 Silicon Graphics, Inc.  All Rights Rese=
rved.
+#
+# This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
