+#! /bin/bash
+# FS QA Test No. 200
+#
+# Check out various mount/remount/unmount scenarious on a read-only bl=
ockdev.
+#
+#---------------------------------------------------------------------=
--
+# Copyright (c) 2009 Christoph Hellwig.
+#
