+#! /bin/bash
+# FS QA Test No. 227
+#
+# xfs_fsr QA tests
+# run xfs_fsr over the test filesystem to give it a wide and varied se=
t of
+# inodes to try to defragment. This is effectively a crash/assert fail=
ure
+# test looking for corruption induced by the kernel inadequately check=
ing
+# the indoes to be swapped. It also is good for validating fsr's attri=
bute fork
+# generation code.
+#
+#---------------------------------------------------------------------=
--
+# Copyright (c) 2010 Dave Chinner.  All Rights Reserved.
+#
+# This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or
+# modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as
+# published by the Free Software Foundation.
